      "side": 1,
      "message": "WebP already does mutex protection when calling SharpYuvInit() in picture_csp_enc.c (see SafeInitSharpYuv) but I guess it\u0027s useful for other callers of the library. The initial idea was that callers should use mutex protection themselves when calling init, but since the init call was moved inside the SharpYuvConvert function I guess they would need to protect the whole call. And I apparently left that undocumented...\nWith this we can remove SafeInitSharpYuv then.",
      "parentUuid": "3856144e_bd879d02",
      "revId": "782ed48cd314b3b09232ea2bf3b54df99f155046",
